# Initialize local repository
```
repo init -u https://github.com/Lunaris-AOSP/android -b 16.2 --git-lfs
```

# Sync up
```
repo sync -c -j$(nproc --all) --force-sync --no-clone-bundle --no-tags
```

# Build

- Set up the build environment
```bash
. b*/env*
```

- Lunch a target
```bash
lunch lineage_codename-bp4a-user
```

- To start compiling
```bash
m bacon
```

- Maintainer prop (define in system/product prop)
```prop
ro.lunaris.maintainer=GHOST | ゴースト
```

- About phone 
```prop
https://github.com/Pong-Development/device_nothing_Pong/blob/luna/overlay/pong/NTSettingsResTarget/res/values/lunaris_strings.xml
```

- If device support UDFPS
```make
TARGET_CUSTOM_UDFPS := true
```

- For GMS
```make
WITH_GMS := true
```

- Use aosp telephony
```make
WITH_GMS_COMMS_SUITE := false
```

- Disable pixel launcher
```make
WITH_PIXEL_LAUNCHER := false
```

- Build google maps
```make
TARGET_USE_MAPS := true
```

- Build google files
```make
TARGET_USE_FILES := true
```

- Use aosp gallery
```make
TARGET_USE_GPHOTOS := false
```

- Disable live wallpaper and other
```make
TARGET_USE_WALLPAPERS := false
```

- Use X reality engine (careful with mtk, causes display stuck issue)
```make
USE_REALITY_ENGINE := true
```

- Set surfaceflinger refreshrate
```make
$(call soong_config_set,surfaceflinger,frame_rate_category_high,120)
$(call soong_config_set,surfaceflinger,frame_rate_category_min,60)
```

- Surface flinger boosting (Smoother scrolling, fewer frame drops but Keeps CPU slightly “awake”)
```make
SURFACE_FLINGER_BOOST := true
```

- Limit AOD refreshrate (SystemUI overlay)
```make
<!-- Preferred max refresh rate at AOD & Ambient Display, if supported by the display. -->
<integer name="config_aodMaxRefreshRate">60</integer>
```
